{"skill":{"slug":"t-trading","displayName":"T Trading"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773492919508,"changelog":"- 首发上线：维加斯通道多维时空共振体系技能（v1.0.0）发布。\n- 支持A股与加密货币市场，自动识别多种技术分析与交易意图关键词。\n- 四维度结构化分析：EMA通道、斐波那契、周期共振、信号合成，输出完整评分与操作建议。\n- 提供具体入场、止损、止盈位及标准化风险提示。\n- 集成常见市场特殊规则（如A股T+1，币市7×24等）。\n- 严格遵循技术分析报告模板，信号不足明确建议观望。","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"README.md","size":7851,"sha256":"18af137652e3eacd1ebcf8a01902b82b320e348a9702f374b2456f266b14e92b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":6016,"sha256":"27eb59814e8c806954933cf6a2a156ecabd761a860e148536f2b21725da32d63","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"vegas-tunnel-resonance-skill.md","size":20580,"sha256":"ed8502a93a629df6f7342d99c3c9ae05e68987d76d5a5229ee88789e29ddffcf","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2755,"sha256":"0ecc277830411c1fbbeafa97803072cd8165676144ca30b1975efcca0a4e3a96","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789176319958,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"c7040e43d21643a9bd82ac9a5be919c8bd828d5e2d7d78c06cfc313214f1c649","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/c7040e43d21643a9bd82ac9a5be919c8bd828d5e2d7d78c06cfc313214f1c649","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780086042037},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":28,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":6,"checkedAt":1789176319958},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a pure Markdown trading-analysis prompt skill with no code execution, persistence, credential access, or hidden data flow, but users should treat its market outputs cautiously.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill asks for market/user-provided data or available real-time data and does not request local files, credentials, accounts, shell access, or transaction authority.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains only Markdown files, declares no dependencies, and the scanner metadata reports no executable scripts.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The activation rules are broad for finance conversations and the report template pushes concrete entry, stop-loss, take-profit, and position-size outputs; this is disclosed and purpose-aligned, but should be routed only for explicit trading-analysis requests.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No artifact instructions install services, write memory, modify tools, persist state, escalate privileges, or perform background activity.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifacts coherently describe a Vegas Tunnel technical-analysis framework for A-shares and crypto using EMA, Fibonacci, multi-timeframe scoring, and structured trading reports.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you want a Chinese-language technical trading-analysis prompt. Ensure your agent activates it only for explicit market-analysis requests, verify any live market data independently, and do not treat its entry, stop-loss, take-profit, or position-sizing outputs as personalized financial advice or permission to trade automatically.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad finance triggers are present in the artifact and could cause over-activation, but they are disclosed routing instructions for a prompt-only market-analysis skill and do not create hidden authority or automatic trades.\n[SQP-3] expected: The fixed Chinese templates are present and may reduce clarity for non-Chinese users, but the skill itself is authored as a Chinese-language framework and includes visible risk disclaimers.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The supplied SARIF run reported no security results, consistent with the inspected artifact being Markdown-only with no execution, persistence, exfiltration, or privilege behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789176319958}}}}}